AreaEvent(0x0,Warp12_12,12,12)
//AreaEvent(0xd,EncounterFOE,18,0,24,5)
AFEV WaitEventTrapsFlag UnitCleanup 0x6
CauseGameOverIfLordDies
END_MAIN

Dunno:
END_MAIN

Tutorial:
END_MAIN

